{"4161430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Golden Escape", "steam_appid": 4161430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seize the Power of Gold</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Golden Escape</i> is a thrilling journey of survival, combat, and fortune—where players chase the elusive Gold Coins in a world filled with chaos. Venture into mysterious dungeons, battle hordes of monsters, and collect powerful Stones and skills to build your own path to victory. Luck is unpredictable, but that uncertainty is what sparks true miracles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Gold Coin Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One coin can change everything.<br>A Gold Coin is more than simple currency—it holds the power of chance itself. No one knows what skill will emerge when you claim it, but the moment luck and strategy align, the <strong>magic of the Gold Coin explodes</strong> into action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Combat and Powerful Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by countless monsters? Don’t back down.<br>With fierce combos and exhilarating impact, <strong>fight through waves of enemies and carve your way to survival</strong>. The intuitive controls and fast-paced action make every battle a true test of skill and reflex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Stone System: Core of Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True strength begins with <strong>Red Stones and Blue Stones</strong>.<br>These Stones are the key to enhancing your skills and unlocking new abilities. Collect and combine them strategically to craft your unique combat style. Every combination reshapes the way you fight, offering endless tactical possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deadly Puzzles and Dangerous Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some places are deadlier than any monster—<strong>the Puzzle Zones</strong>.<br>One wrong move can end everything. In these perilous spaces, <strong>precise control and calm decision-making</strong> are the keys to survival. Each region introduces new puzzles and traps that test both your mind and reflexes as you fight for escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World in Gentle Cartoon Rendering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even amid the chaos of battle, the world remains soothing to the eye.<br>The soft, vibrant look of <strong>cartoon-style rendering</strong> creates a unique atmosphere where tension and tranquility coexist. Experience a world both ruined and beautiful—a world of light and gold waiting to be reclaimed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Luck. Your Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a place where despair repeats endlessly, only one goal remains—<strong>Golden Escape</strong>.<br>Can you reach the final door and claim your golden freedom?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seize the Power of Gold</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Golden Escape</i> is a thrilling journey of survival, combat, and fortune—where players chase the elusive Gold Coins in a world filled with chaos. Venture into mysterious dungeons, battle hordes of monsters, and collect powerful Stones and skills to build your own path to victory. Luck is unpredictable, but that uncertainty is what sparks true miracles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Gold Coin Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One coin can change everything.<br>A Gold Coin is more than simple currency—it holds the power of chance itself. No one knows what skill will emerge when you claim it, but the moment luck and strategy align, the <strong>magic of the Gold Coin explodes</strong> into action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Combat and Powerful Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surrounded by countless monsters? Don’t back down.<br>With fierce combos and exhilarating impact, <strong>fight through waves of enemies and carve your way to survival</strong>. The intuitive controls and fast-paced action make every battle a true test of skill and reflex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Stone System: Core of Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True strength begins with <strong>Red Stones and Blue Stones</strong>.<br>These Stones are the key to enhancing your skills and unlocking new abilities. Collect and combine them strategically to craft your unique combat style. Every combination reshapes the way you fight, offering endless tactical possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deadly Puzzles and Dangerous Zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some places are deadlier than any monster—<strong>the Puzzle Zones</strong>.<br>One wrong move can end everything. In these perilous spaces, <strong>precise control and calm decision-making</strong> are the keys to survival. Each region introduces new puzzles and traps that test both your mind and reflexes as you fight for escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World in Gentle Cartoon Rendering</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even amid the chaos of battle, the world remains soothing to the eye.<br>The soft, vibrant look of <strong>cartoon-style rendering</strong> creates a unique atmosphere where tension and tranquility coexist. Experience a world both ruined and beautiful—a world of light and gold waiting to be reclaimed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Luck. Your Escape.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a place where despair repeats endlessly, only one goal remains—<strong>Golden Escape</strong>.<br>Can you reach the final door and claim your golden freedom?</p>", "short_description": "An action survival game where you collect Gold Coins for random skills, upgrade abilities with Stones, and overcome monsters and puzzles.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, French, German, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161430/a00d0b6c9f8d25dbb10468cd2738e6d8f58ee1d2/header.jpg?t=1781952444", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161430/dbfecce5cf023cdd3c720d5c470ab0e0f54a8641/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781952444", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4161430/dbfecce5cf023cdd3c720d5c470ab0e0f54a8641/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781952444", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> window 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4790 CPU @ 3.60GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct X 11 compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> window 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i8 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct X 11 compatible</li></ul>"}, "